<mxCell id="1 _title" value="&lt;b&gt;GantryCode — how a typed G-code line becomes motor steps&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="1100" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="1 _sub" value="Arduino Nano firmware as in the uploaded project (uncommitted working copy, Mar 2025 build).&amp;nbsp; Solid arrows = order of execution with the data handed along.&amp;nbsp; Page 2 zooms into MotionControl::moveLine()." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="52" width="1380" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
