<mxCell id="1 _lgt8" value="Text printed to Serial" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=12;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1224" y="456" width="190" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="1 _lgt_a" value="solid arrow = execution order / data passed&lt;br&gt;dashed gold = read/write of a global&lt;br&gt;◆ = decision&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;  red ● = known issue (see panel)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1166" y="498" width="250" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="1 _issues" value="&lt;b&gt;KNOWN ISSUES&amp;nbsp; (layer “Known issues” — hide it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;in View ▸ Layers / Ctrl+Shift+L)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1&amp;nbsp; Commands without params (G90, G91, M114…)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; are never enqueued → loop() dequeues an&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; empty object → “command not recognized”.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2&amp;nbsp; Invalid command: leftover debug code&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; dequeues and prints a buffered command.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3&amp;nbsp; A missing X or Y stays −32768, so “G1 X10”&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; sends Y toward −32768 mm.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4&amp;nbsp; G2/G3 arcs are drawn as straight lines;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; G0 and G1 behave the same.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5&amp;nbsp; Every move starts at (0,0): Xcurrent /&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Ycurrent are never updated.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6&amp;nbsp; M114/M119 match is_modifier first, so&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; send_to_getter() can never run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;7&amp;nbsp; M17 M18 G92 G28 M203 M201 parse fine but&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; have no handler → “not recognized”.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;8&amp;nbsp; convertToSteps() returns a 16-bit int →&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; moves longer than ~20.48 mm overflow.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;9&amp;nbsp; Step period is 2·dt, and diagonal steps run&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; X then Y in sequence → slower than F." style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff5f5;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#333333;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="bugs"><mxGeometry x="1460" y="100" width="330" height="470" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
